<title>USA: Sturm, Ruger to buy stake in foundry.</title>
<headline>Sturm, Ruger to buy stake in foundry.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHPORT, Conn. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sturm, Ruger &amp; Co plans to buy Callaway Golf Co's 50 percent interest in the recently completed Antelope Hills foundry for $7 million.</p>
<p>Sturm Ruger will be the sole operator of the facility, it said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Callaway Golf also agreed to order an additional one million cast titanium golf club heads from Ruger Investment Casting, over the company's existing orders.</p>
<p>Shipments are set to begin early 1998.</p>
</text>
